<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Dashboard', apiBase, active: 'Dashboard' }) %>

<h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Dashboard</h1>
<p class="mt-1 max-w-2xl text-sm text-gray-600">
  Point the compiler at your source folders, run it, and browse what came out.
</p>

<div id="stat-cards" class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4"></div>

<div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-6">
  <section class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-card">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 px-5 py-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Run compiler</h2>
        <span id="build-status-badge" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-600">Ready</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <button id="sources-picker-toggle" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50">Sources to include <span id="sources-picker-count" class="text-xs text-gray-400"></span></button>
        <button id="run-options-toggle" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50">Run options <span id="run-options-count" class="text-xs text-gray-400"></span></button>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600" title="Off: only new/changed files are (re)processed, resuming where the last run left off. On: every file is reprocessed from scratch.">
          <input id="force-rebuild" type="checkbox" class="rounded border-gray-300 text-accent focus:ring-accent/30" />
          Rebuild all files
        </label>
        <button id="clear-log" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50">Clear log</button>
        <button id="stop-build" type="button" class="hidden inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-red-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50">Stop</button>
        <button id="run-build" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-accent px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-accent-dark">Run compiler</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="sources-picker" class="hidden border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 px-5 py-3">
      <p class="mb-2 text-xs text-gray-500">Only checked top-level folders under <code class="rounded bg-white px-1 py-0.5">data/raw/</code> are read into this run. Unchecked folders are left as-is — nothing is deleted, and re-checking them later picks their topics back up without needing a forced rebuild.</p>
      <div id="sources-picker-list" class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="run-options" class="hidden border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 px-5 py-3">
      <p class="mb-2 text-xs text-gray-500">Extra compiler passes. These roughly increase LLM cost per run — see the <code class="rounded bg-white px-1 py-0.5">--critic-pass</code>, <code class="rounded bg-white px-1 py-0.5">--use-corrections</code>, and <code class="rounded bg-white px-1 py-0.5">--redact-pii</code> flags in <code class="rounded bg-white px-1 py-0.5">compiler/main.py</code>.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start gap-4 text-sm">
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600" title="Run a second LLM pass over each synthesized page, stripping sentences it can't ground in the source chunks. Roughly doubles per-page LLM cost.">
          <input id="run-opt-critic-pass" type="checkbox" class="rounded border-gray-300 text-accent focus:ring-accent/30" />
          Critic pass
        </label>
        <label id="run-opt-critic-samples-label" class="hidden flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600" title="Run the critic pass this many times per page and only strip a sentence a majority flagged (reduces judge flakiness).">
          Samples
          <input id="run-opt-critic-samples" type="number" min="1" max="9" value="1" class="w-14 rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm" />
        </label>
        <label id="run-opt-critic-regenerate-label" class="hidden flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600" title="When the critic strips more than 20% of a page, regenerate it once with the critic's findings fed back into the prompt, instead of shipping a heavily-stripped draft.">
          <input id="run-opt-critic-regenerate" type="checkbox" class="rounded border-gray-300 text-accent focus:ring-accent/30" />
          Regenerate stripped pages
        </label>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600" title="Feed human review corrections (data/review_corrections.json) into the extraction prompt as few-shot examples.">
          <input id="run-opt-use-corrections" type="checkbox" class="rounded border-gray-300 text-accent focus:ring-accent/30" />
          Use review corrections
        </label>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-600" title="Redact SSNs, credit cards, API keys, phone numbers, and IPv4 addresses from chunk text before it's sent to the LLM for extraction. Does not redact email addresses or names.">
          <input id="run-opt-redact-pii" type="checkbox" class="rounded border-gray-300 text-accent focus:ring-accent/30" />
          Redact PII before extraction
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4">
      <pre id="build-log" class="h-64 overflow-auto rounded-lg bg-gray-900 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-100">Ready. Click "Run compiler" to start.</pre>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">Stopping (or a crash) is safe to resume from — the next non-forced run only reprocesses what didn't finish, it doesn't start over.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-card">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 px-5 py-4">
      <div>
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Source folders</h2>
        <p id="sources-subtitle" class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-gray-500">Folders the compiler reads raw notes, emails, and files from.</p>
      </div>
      <button id="add-source-toggle" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-source-border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-source hover:bg-source-bg">+ Add folder</button>
    </div>
    <div id="add-source-form" class="hidden border-b border-gray-100 p-5"></div>
    <div id="sources-grid" class="grid gap-3 p-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white shadow-card">
    <div class="border-b border-gray-100 px-5 py-4">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Files</h2>
      <p class="mt-0.5 text-sm text-gray-500">Browse data/raw/ like a file manager. Click Preview to see a file's content.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-gray-100 px-5 py-2.5">
      <nav id="breadcrumbs" class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-1 text-sm"></nav>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <input id="file-search" type="search" placeholder="Search this folder…" class="w-40 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-2.5 py-1 text-sm focus:border-accent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent/20" />
        <button id="new-folder-toggle" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50">+ New folder</button>
        <button id="upload-files-toggle" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-accent px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white hover:bg-accent-dark">⬆ Upload files</button>
        <input id="upload-files-input" type="file" multiple class="hidden" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="new-folder-form" class="hidden mx-5 mt-4 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2"></div>
    <div id="upload-status" class="hidden mx-5 mt-4 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-source-border bg-source-bg/60 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-source"></div>
    <div id="file-grid" data-dropzone class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 p-4 transition-colors sm:grid-cols-4 md:grid-cols-6 lg:grid-cols-8"></div>
  </section>
</div>

<div id="preview-modal" class="hidden"></div>

<%- include('partials/foot', { clientScript: 'dashboard' }) %>
